Ordelis
=======

Ordelis, formerly named Synapse, began as a fork of the open-source project MCO
and still contains MCO code.

Upstream project   : MCO, https://github.com/mco-org/mco, version 0.12.1
Upstream copyright : Copyright (c) 2026 mco maintainers
License            : MIT. The full text is in the LICENSE file, which is unchanged.
Fork base          : commit 3cfce13 ("fix(ci): repair npm publishing and prepare
                     v0.12.1 (#131)", 2026-10-07)

The upstream commit history up to the fork base is retained in this repository.
Which files come from MCO, and which were added for Ordelis, is recorded in
docs/migration/ordelis.md#original-mco-foundations-versus-ordelis-specific-work

Bundled fonts carry their own licenses, listed in
desktop/src/assets/fonts/FONT-LICENSES.txt
